profile.LOW=Low
profile.MEDIUM=Medium
profile.HIGH=High
profile.comment=Low drops the far land's pixel texture. Medium and High differ in how fine it stays with distance.

screen.LOOK=Look
screen.LOOK.comment=Flat steps and dither: how pixel-true the picture is.
screen.ATMOSPHERE=Atmosphere
screen.ATMOSPHERE.comment=Mist, and later haze and fog. Needs VOID Gloam for the world's weather and land.
screen.DEBUG=Debug
screen.DEBUG.comment=Views for checking the pack, the LOD join and the VOID bridge.

option.COLOR_STEPS=Colour Steps
option.COLOR_STEPS.comment=Levels per colour channel in the final picture, with a dither between them. Off keeps full colour.
value.COLOR_STEPS.0=Off

option.DITHER=Dither
option.DITHER.comment=A 4x4 ordered dither at colour steps and at the edges of light bands, on the world's 16-pixel grid.

option.LIGHT_STEPS=Light Steps
option.LIGHT_STEPS.comment=How many flat levels the sky light and block light have.

option.sunPathRotation=Sun Path Tilt
option.sunPathRotation.comment=How far the sun's path leans south. Vanilla is 0.
suffix.sunPathRotation=°

option.FAR_TEXTURE=Far Land Texture
option.FAR_TEXTURE.comment=A pixel texture on far land, on the world grid, coarser with distance.

option.FAR_TEXTURE_PIXELS=Far Texel Size
option.FAR_TEXTURE_PIXELS.comment=How many screen pixels a far texel spans before it doubles in size.
suffix.FAR_TEXTURE_PIXELS= px

option.FAR_FADE=Far Fade
option.FAR_FADE.comment=Far land fades into the horizon in steps toward the edge of what is drawn.

option.VALLEY_MIST=Valley Mist
option.VALLEY_MIST.comment=Mist pooling in valleys and along water at dawn, thinner after sunset, gone by mid-morning. Needs VOID Gloam.

option.MIST_SAMPLES=Mist Samples
option.MIST_SAMPLES.comment=How many places along each view ray the mist is read at. More follows the valleys more closely.

option.MIST_THICKNESS=Mist Thickness
option.MIST_THICKNESS.comment=How opaque the mist is, as a share of the default.
suffix.MIST_THICKNESS=x

option.MIST_FORCE=Force Mist
option.MIST_FORCE.comment=Lays the mist at this percentage of full strength whatever the hour, to check it. Off uses VOID Gloam's time of day.
value.MIST_FORCE.0=Off
option.DEBUG_JOIN=Mark LOD Join
option.DEBUG_JOIN.comment=A magenta line where the chunks end and the LOD's land begins, over the finished picture.

option.DEBUG_VIEW=Debug View
option.DEBUG_VIEW.comment=Depth: chunks warm, LOD cool, bands at each doubling of distance; magenta where the LOD is in front of the chunks, red where its depth is read wrong.
value.DEBUG_VIEW.0=Off
value.DEBUG_VIEW.1=Depth
value.DEBUG_VIEW.2=Normals
value.DEBUG_VIEW.3=Light Map
value.DEBUG_VIEW.4=Albedo
value.DEBUG_VIEW.5=G-buffer Flags
value.DEBUG_VIEW.6=VOID Bridge
value.DEBUG_VIEW.7=VOID Near Tiles
